OL,3,GNEWSAGold postbox to honour Manx
OL,4,Aathlete
OL,5,
OL,6,FA postbox has been painted gold in
OL,7,Fcelebration of a two-time
OL,8,Fgold-medallist athlete.
OL,10,FManx-born cyclist Matthew Bostock, from
OL,11,FMarown, was crowned world champion in
OL,12,Fthe 40km race at the 2026 Commonwealth
OL,13,FGames in August, and won the Men's
OL,14,Fscratch race at the UCI Track Cycling
OL,15,FWorld Championships in China last
OL,16,Fmonth.
OL,18,FThe idea to honour the 29-year-old with
OL,19,Fa gold postbox was put to the Isle of
OL,20,FMan Post Office by Marown
OL,21,FCommissioners.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,447,445,260,140,0,100
